      "side": 1,
      "message": "Generally looks sane, but I\u0027m curious about the lifetime of the boosted transaction vs the the length of the task boosted interval. Relatedly, if the transaction is started while a task holds an rt_mutex, if a high priority task grabs the mutex and boosts the task\u0027s priority, is there a communicative mechanism to apply the boosting to the transaction?",
      "revId": "3b36c9b8c6f4182896b5d10b04bd2466c0fefe8b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
