        "id": 1869395
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-11-06T06:19:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, only the priority at the start of the transaction is inherited and this is kept on the target until the reply is complete. Any changes to the callers priority at a later stage are not propagated to the target while the transaction is active. I think this is a good point.",
      "parentUuid": "307cbfc8_efc54bda",
      "revId": "3b36c9b8c6f4182896b5d10b04bd2466c0fefe8b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
